# Normalise line endings.
#
# CRLF inside a multi-line className is a real bug in a React app: HTML parsing
# strips the CR from attribute values, so the string React holds on the client
# and the attribute it finds in the parsed DOM differ, and React reports a
# hydration mismatch on every affected element. Keeping the working tree on LF
# removes that whole class of failure.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico  binary
*.mp4  binary
*.ttf  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
